# Morning flyers (today + tomorrow @ 9am CT)

Date-keyed finished flyers in `config/morning_flyers.json` are the **main** morning look.
The morning Autopilot post runs at **9:00 AM America/Chicago** and promotes **today’s
full day**, then **tomorrow**. Prefer today’s date-key flyer when today has events;
else tomorrow’s flyer. Flyer date keys match the **event calendar day** on the plate.

## Hard creative ban — generic mystic AI template (Founder Aug 14, 2026 ~1:35pm CT)

**Rejected live look:** Fri Aug 14 navy “FRIDAY AT Sacred Ground” equal-card collage with
pristine AI singing bowls, shamanic drum, glowing healing hands, “Akashic Records” prop
book — the Canva/Midjourney wellness starter pack. Founder: *“I don’t want them to go oh
look Sacred Ground’s using the AI. Completely individual, out of the box, nothing like this.”*

### BAN on morning flyers / new social art
- Generic mystic AI collage: floating singing bowls, glowing healing hands, pristine tarot
  fan, crystal clusters on black velvet, Flower of Life wallpaper, “Akashic Records” prop
  books, ethereal purple fog — the wellness starter pack everyone ships
- Same factory layout every day (three equal dark cards + right mystic collage + gold script)
  when it reads as a template, not a shop-made plate

### REQUIRE instead
- **Shop-made / individual:** real Sacred Ground storefront or interior when available,
  real practitioner vibes, handcrafted collage, bold poster / typographic art, unexpected
  color, photography-first, or one strong original illustration — **not** the same mystic
  object dump
- Designed-in Chicagoland pride (Premier / #1 / Voted #1 per slot rules)
- Still readable schedule info; **no prices** on graphics
- Equal visual space for practitioners when multi-event
- **NEVER** reuse image URLs (`image_usage` lifetime block)

## Sacred Ground daily flyer system (readable equal info — vary the art)

Reference readability (not a daily clone): `assets/sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png`.

Use **versions of a readable schedule system** — not an exact clone every day (stale),
**not** busy collage soup, and **not** the banned mystic AI template above.

| Zone | Content |
|---|---|
| **Header** | Day / shop identity (mix fonts; gold script OK sometimes — not mandatory every day) |
| **Schedule** | 1–3 **equal-weight** event blocks — title + host + time + short keywords |
| **Art** | Shop-made / photo / bold poster / original illustration — never generic mystic dump |
| **Footer** | Circular logo + `shopsacredground.com` + `847-749-3922` + come-as-you-are energy |

## Equal space (hard — Founder Aug 7, 2026)

- Multi-event days: **every event/practitioner gets the same card size and visual weight**
- Pattern: Aug 6 gold-standard stacked equal cards
- **FORBIDDEN:** one hero photo/title + tiny “Also today” / corner badge for a second practitioner
  (Aug 7 FB `sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-07-reflexology.png` — Cheryl huge, Robert squeezed — rejected)
- Aug 7 IG equal-card variant is the correct multi-event energy for that day
- PIL compositor + `build_generation_prompt` must enforce equal cards when 2+ events

## Layout mix (required)

- Multi-event days → **always equal visual weight** per practitioner (never hero + tiny secondary)
- Vary the *look* day to day (poster / photo / handcrafted collage / original illustration) so
  the feed does not read as one mystic-card template factory
- Single-event days may use an artistic hero **only** when still highly readable
- `generate-morning-flyers` / `build_generation_prompt` must ban mystic AI starter-pack imagery
  and require shop-individual energy + designed-in pride

## Never put prices on flyers

- **Never** include `$`, dollar amounts, ticket costs, session fees, or “$55 / $99” style prices on morning flyer graphics.
- Do not bake `Event.cost` or TEC cost fields into flyer labels, overlays, or prompts.
- Captions may mention booking links; the **graphic** stays price-free.
- “FREE” for Free Community Meditation / free community events is OK (not a dollar amount).

## Single-image mode (hard — Founder Aug 10, 2026)

- **One excellent primary plate** (`url` / `local`) posts to **both Facebook and Instagram**
- Do **not** generate or require a separate `url_instagram` — dual IG variants are retired (Aug 10 Lisa Maria muddy IG proved weaker variants hurt quality)
- Legacy `url_instagram` is ignored unless an entry explicitly sets `allow_ig_variant: true`
- Pipeline plans the image once and reuses the same media URL on both platforms
- Aug 6 gold standard stays single-URL (do not overwrite)

### Color energy (hard — Founder Aug 10 + Aug 14, 2026)

The shared plate must be **colorful, bright, interesting, engaging**:
- Unexpected bold color welcome (coral, chartreuse, teal, sunflower, eggplant) — not only navy+gold
- Strong contrast and shop-individual energy beat polished mystic gloss
- Generators + selection must **reject** drab / muddy / beige / grey / desaturated purple sludge,
  empty near-black voids, giant blank cards, thin faint line-art on a dead field, **and** the
  generic mystic AI starter pack (Aug 14 reject)
- Aug 10 IG Lisa Maria muddy-purple empty-card plate is the energy reject example
- Dark elegant backgrounds OK only when bright accents carry the energy — never a mystic void
- Code gate: `flyer_passes_visual_energy` (min colorfulness + accent ratio)

## Every day

- Every Chicago calendar day should have a Thursday-style primary flyer (1–3 events max, or a warm visit-day flyer when empty) shared on FB+IG.
- Prebuild: `python3 -m marketing generate-morning-flyers --days 7`
- Morning automation @ 9am: ensure flyer for **today + tomorrow** before publish (see AUTOMATION-DRAFT.md / docs/MORNING-FLYERS.md).
- CLI tip: `generate-morning-flyers --start-offset 0 --days 2` for today+tomorrow.

## Shop pride (Founder Aug 11 + Aug 12 FINAL)

- Do **not** overlay Chicago #1 / favorite badges onto already-made morning flyers
- Caption + first-comment claims stay ON
- Every **NEW** AI morning flyer generation/remake MUST include designed-in pride
  via `social_proof.designed_in_generation_brief` in `build_generation_prompt`
  (`designed_in_required: true`)
- `badge_on_morning_flyers` stays false — no post-hoc sticker path
- Never reuse a morning flyer URL that already appears in `image_usage` (lifetime)

