- Do not restore rejected atmospheric `sg-morning-creative-*` plates into rotation
- Do not overwrite a Founder-loved day’s flyer when redesigning other dates
- Do not overwrite the Aug 6 gold standard (`sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png`)
- Do not republish Aug 6 just to split FB/IG images
- Do not ship hero + tiny secondary corner badges on multi-event days
- Do not remake finished flyers just to stamp shop-pride overlays
- Do **not** remake + republish an already-live morning post for aesthetic alone
  unless the Founder explicitly asks (Aug 14: leave live flyer; explore concepts
